- virtio-fs: add multi-queue support (Peter-Jan Gootzen)
- virtio-fs: limit number of request queues (Peter-Jan Gootzen)
- perf vendor events: Add JSON metrics for Arm CMN (Jing Zhang)
- perf jevents: Add support for Arm CMN PMU aliasing (Jing Zhang)
- perf test: Add pmu-event test for "Compat" and new event_field. (Jing Zhang)
- perf test: Make matching_pmu effective (Jing Zhang)
- perf jevents: Support EventidCode and NodeType (Jing Zhang)
- perf metric: "Compat" supports regular expression matching identifiers (Jing Zhang)
- perf pmu: "Compat" supports regular expression matching identifiers (Jing Zhang)
- anolis: perf/arm-cmn: Fix variable type error (Jing Zhang)
- anolis: Fix dev->node equal to NUMA_NO_NODE issue (leoliu-oc)
- anolis: x86/pci-dma: Fix logical error in patch_do_basic_check() (leoliu-oc)
- anolis: xfs: try to flush logs for secondary inodes (Gao Xiang)
- anolis: bpftool: Fix the return value check in show_prog() (Tianchen Ding)
- fuse: clear FR_SENT when re-adding requests into pending list (Hou Tao)
- fuse: set FR_PENDING atomically in fuse_resend() (Hou Tao)
- fuse: Use the high bit of request ID for indicating resend requests (Zhao Chen)
- fuse: Introduce a new notification type for resend pending requests (Zhao Chen)
- anolis: virtio_net: avoid canceling worker if not initialized (Heng Qi)
- anolis: kabi: fix arm64 kabi break (Guixin Liu)
- iommu/vt-d: Improve ITE fault handling if target device isn't present (Ethan Zhao)
- anolis: virtio_net: avoid driver waiting for requests indefinitely (Heng Qi)
- anolis: virtio_net: make virtnet_cvq_response return the code (Heng Qi)
- anolis: Fix unicode encoding error when compiling tools/perf (Guanjun)
- anolis: sched: optimize task_allowed_cpu() (Cruz Zhao)
- anolis: sched: delete the secondary pointers of group balancer (Cruz Zhao)
- anolis: drm/phytium: Bugfix Xorg startup for ps23xx when using pe2201 bmc card (yuan0927)
- HID: logitech-hidpp: Fix kernel crash on receiver USB disconnect (Hans de Goede) {CVE-2023-52478}
